# DERIVATION (intermediate, independent of time). For each conflicting agent designation, written with
# query-internal predicates outside the ontology: the agents it counts as one (rbow:joins), the constraints
# it applies to (rbow:appliesTo) and, for a dynamic one, the instances it applies in (rbow:appliesIn). The
# conflict derivations and the worklist then read "an agent a designation in force counts as one with the
# principal" (Botha and Eloff 2001, Table 1 row 3 and Table 2; clif [rbo-u3], [rbo-u4]) as one pattern:
# ?g a <kind> ; rbow:inForceAt ?evalTime ; rbow:joins ?x , ?y ; rbow:appliesTo ?c [; rbow:appliesIn ?instance].
#   joins     - the agent it designates (RBO_0000138), or each member (BFO_0000129) of the group it
#               designates (RBO_0000139)
#   appliesTo - each constraint in its constraint scope (RBO_0000140); with none, every constraint with a
#               cardinality (RBO_0000201), as every constraint a query counts has
#   appliesIn - each instance prescribed by a plan in its plan scope (RBO_0000115); with none, every
#               instance something is part of (BFO_0000132) or a work item is in (RBO_0000142), which is
#               where the queries find the instances they count in
# Run once per dataset, before the evaluation times: none of this depends on time, and no derivation writes
# a triple it reads.
PREFIX rbo:  <https://example.org/rbac-bfo/>
PREFIX rbow: <https://example.org/rbac-bfo/work#>
PREFIX obo:  <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/>
PREFIX cco:  <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/>
PREFIX rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>
PREFIX xsd:  <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#>
CONSTRUCT { ?g rbow:joins ?agent ; rbow:appliesTo ?c ; rbow:appliesIn ?instance }
WHERE {
  {
    ?g a rbo:RBO_0000045 ; rbo:RBO_0000138|rbo:RBO_0000139/^obo:BFO_0000129 ?agent .
  } UNION {
    ?g a rbo:RBO_0000045 ; rbo:RBO_0000140 ?c .
  } UNION {
    ?g a rbo:RBO_0000045 .
    FILTER NOT EXISTS { ?g rbo:RBO_0000140 ?anyC }
    ?c rbo:RBO_0000201 ?n .
  } UNION {
    ?g a rbo:RBO_0000047 ; rbo:RBO_0000115 ?plan .
    ?instance cco:ont00001920 ?plan .
  } UNION {
    ?g a rbo:RBO_0000047 .
    FILTER NOT EXISTS { ?g rbo:RBO_0000115 ?anyPlan }
    { ?part obo:BFO_0000132 ?instance } UNION { ?item rbo:RBO_0000142 ?instance }
  }
}
